{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.32.20.73","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"219a77a7949e6807d1a8aa097469df5a","RawContent":"Hello, \n\n\nDoes anyone know of an affordable photographer for a cenote trash the dress in the Playa Del Carmen area!?! I am looking for one around $900.","Attachments":[],"Id":1909648,"PostDate":1453067786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, <br><br>\nDoes anyone know of an affordable photographer for a cenote trash the dress in the Playa Del Carmen area!?! I am looking for one around $900. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lditizio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.240.49.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433584943,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283410.jpg?_r=1474854183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DLS2016","Id":283410,"Name":"DLS2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f0c8a2b5e64db9698d64c94dee4e2ee7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DLS2016\" post=\"1909648\" timestamp=\"1453082186\"]\nHello,\n\nDoes anyone know of an affordable photographer for a cenote trash the dress in the Playa Del Carmen area!?! I am looking for one around $900.[\/quote]@[member=\"DLS2016\"]  for $900 you might find photographers for beach Trash The Dress!  simply because for Cenote TTD they mostly use different\/ special equipment and that costs a bit!\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909651,"PostDate":1453069615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DLS2016, on 17 January 2016 - 09:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello,<br><br>\nDoes anyone know of an affordable photographer for a cenote trash the dress in the Playa Del Carmen area!?! I am looking for one around $900.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283410\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283410-dls2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DLS2016<\/span><\/a> \u00a0for $900 you might find photographers for beach Trash The Dress! \u00a0simply because for Cenote TTD they mostly use different\/ special equipment and that costs a bit!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3257fd316a6a9f419560bd90063db22","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@DLS2016&amp;nbsp; Joyce is right. That&#039;s a tight budget for a cenote trash the dress. But having said that, it&#039;s definitely worth looking that some of the photographers and asking for quotes from them. They all have different styles too so it&#039;s worth looking to see if there is also a style that you like. There are some wonderful photographers in the Riviera Maya area.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you go to the top and look at the vendor reviews you&#039;ll find the names that you can check on the internet and contact them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909665,"PostDate":1453086059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@DLS2016\u00a0 Joyce is right. That's a tight budget for a cenote trash the dress. But having said that, it's definitely worth looking that some of the photographers and asking for quotes from them. They all have different styles too so it's worth looking to see if there is also a style that you like. There are some wonderful photographers in the Riviera Maya area.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you go to the top and look at the vendor reviews you'll find the names that you can check on the internet and contact them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1453132295,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06b981a31499a0c0a2bce918b668cac5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community DLS2016 and Congrats on your upcoming Cenote TTD in Playa del Carmen!!! Those photo sessions are so Amazing and some of our favorites to shoot!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce is right, however, and just the entry to local Cenotes can vary between $300 - $500 USD, and is shot using underwater equipment worth MANY thousands of dollars... so your current spending plan may not work for those.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To decide whether the higher expense is worth it for you, you&#039;d need to balance the trade-off of spending more $$ - with the the lifetime of cherishing the images you&#039;d get from it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some of our favorites.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152534016294487.1073741903.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cenote Trash the Dress Story 1:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10511181_10152534020289487_7583945835974197315_n.jpg?oh=d422c6d71c1153546765146b24e51f21&amp;amp;oe=56FFCE70\" alt=\"10511181_10152534020289487_7583945835974\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152076626324487.1073741872.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cenote Trash the Dress Story 2:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/988834_10152076628604487_681292603_n.jpg?oh=5bf6ff2703570461de84566d36472ef4&amp;amp;oe=57423C04\" alt=\"988834_10152076628604487_681292603_n.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;and&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151410356994487.498311.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;....Beach Trash the Dress Story 1&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/539411_10151410360229487_131507444_n.jpg?oh=40d148d87699aa7725fc597065aec3e4&amp;amp;oe=5733040F\" alt=\"539411_10151410360229487_131507444_n.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with making the right choices for You!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909682,"PostDate":1453131586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community DLS2016 and Congrats on your upcoming Cenote TTD in Playa del Carmen!!! Those photo sessions are so Amazing and some of our favorites to shoot!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Joyce is right, however, and just the entry to local Cenotes can vary between $300 - $500 USD, and is shot using underwater equipment worth MANY thousands of dollars... so your current spending plan may not work for those.<\/p>\n<p>To decide whether the higher expense is worth it for you, you'd need to balance the trade-off of spending more $$ - with the the lifetime of cherishing the images you'd get from it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some of our favorites.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152534016294487.1073741903.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cenote Trash the Dress Story 1:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10511181_10152534020289487_7583945835974197315_n.jpg?oh=d422c6d71c1153546765146b24e51f21&oe=56FFCE70\" alt=\"10511181_10152534020289487_7583945835974\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152076626324487.1073741872.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cenote Trash the Dress Story 2:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/v\/t1.0-9\/988834_10152076628604487_681292603_n.jpg?oh=5bf6ff2703570461de84566d36472ef4&oe=57423C04\" alt=\"988834_10152076628604487_681292603_n.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151410356994487.498311.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>....Beach Trash the Dress Story 1<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/539411_10151410360229487_131507444_n.jpg?oh=40d148d87699aa7725fc597065aec3e4&oe=5733040F\" alt=\"539411_10151410360229487_131507444_n.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with making the right choices for You!<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!!! team MTM <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.6.197.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbc1dc969c20df651b8f9f8ec27dcd08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Gonzalo Nunez is shooting both my wedding and doing a Trash the Dress. &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I felt like he has great rates! &amp;nbsp;My TTD is going to be $600, which it is normally $1300 for him. &amp;nbsp;He may have given me a good deal because we booked him for the wedding too but he just offered up the discount and I didn&#039;t really need to haggle at all. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ll take it! &amp;nbsp;We are getting 2 hours at the Cenote and 1 hour at the beach for that. &amp;nbsp;We do need to pay the cenote entrance fee ourselves though so that will be a separate charge. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think it would be worth at least emailing him and letting him know what you would like to spend. &amp;nbsp;He has been very quick with &amp;nbsp;responses and easy to work with. &amp;nbsp;Good luck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909734,"PostDate":1453233935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Gonzalo Nunez is shooting both my wedding and doing a Trash the Dress. \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I felt like he has great rates! \u00a0My TTD is going to be $600, which it is normally $1300 for him. \u00a0He may have given me a good deal because we booked him for the wedding too but he just offered up the discount and I didn't really need to haggle at all. \u00a0I'll take it! \u00a0We are getting 2 hours at the Cenote and 1 hour at the beach for that. \u00a0We do need to pay the cenote entrance fee ourselves though so that will be a separate charge. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think it would be worth at least emailing him and letting him know what you would like to spend. \u00a0He has been very quick with \u00a0responses and easy to work with. \u00a0Good luck!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsayhay36@gmail.com","IpAddress":"206.144.97.58","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449150782,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Haylinds","Id":285507,"Name":"Haylinds","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.32.20.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9241be1d49fcfb8c76e2bf75d95f132","RawContent":"@[member=\"Haylinds\"] thank you for the information. I have emailed him!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909737,"PostDate":1453242108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285507\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/285507-haylinds\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Haylinds<\/span><\/a> thank you for the information. I have emailed him! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lditizio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.240.49.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433584943,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283410.jpg?_r=1474854183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DLS2016","Id":283410,"Name":"DLS2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79868,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2440d65f61bd8fe8fb631eabfb891722","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"DLS2016\"]! Our normal rates for underwater sessions are within your budget. Make sure to mention this board so that we can put together an additional discount for you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can check out these links for useful information on Underwater Cenote TTD sessions:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 things you need to know before your underwater cenote trash the dress photo session: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/7-tips-for-your-underwater-trash-the-dress-photo-session&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/7-tips-for-your-underwater-trash-the-dress-photo-session&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Cenote Trash The Dress sessions in Riviera Maya:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/CenoteTTD&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/CenoteTTD&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i0.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-Day-Story_0001.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i2.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-Day-Story_0002.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i2.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/01\/1-2016-Wedding-Trends-WeddingDayStory.jpg?resize=953%2C634\" alt=\"1-2016-Wedding-Trends-WeddingDayStory.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909834,"PostDate":1453376647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283410\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283410-dls2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">DLS2016<\/span><\/a>! Our normal rates for underwater sessions are within your budget. Make sure to mention this board so that we can put together an additional discount for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can check out these links for useful information on Underwater Cenote TTD sessions:\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul><li>7 things you need to know before your underwater cenote trash the dress photo session: <a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/7-tips-for-your-underwater-trash-the-dress-photo-session' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/7-tips...s-photo-session<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Cenote Trash The Dress sessions in Riviera Maya:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/CenoteTTD' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/CenoteTTD<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i0.wp.com\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/10\/Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-Day-Story_0001.jpg?resize=800%2C534\" alt=\"Cenote-Trash-the-Dress-Sessions-Wedding-\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' 