{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.203.215.33","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3728ee039016a1aac10c4744d2f0be8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey friends!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I am at the very first stages. My fiance and I live in Manhattan, but want destination. I&#039;m a little overwhelmed with the choices &amp;amp; every time I think we found the perfect place we find an issue as to why it won&#039;t work. I know it&#039;s OUR day &amp;amp; we&#039;ve already gotten the opinions of everyone imaginable, but we do want to be some what accommodating to our guests. So here are some guidelines \/ dreams we are hoping to find:\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking Bahamas, mainly because it is a short flight from NYC. It&#039;s also the only island we have been to together in the Caribbean.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What other options are close?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We don&#039;t want to blow the bank - $30K MAX.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We liked Sandals, either Bahamas or Jamaica, but they are adults only.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As great as that sounds, there is a handful of close friends that would have to bring their kids.. and we&#039;re cool with that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Loved the Cove Eleuthera, but it seems super secluded. We don&#039;t want our guests to have to go broke over us if they only have the hotel&#039;s restaurants to choose choose from.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we might want all inclusive, but not a spring break atmosphere..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m probably talking myself into a corner, but I know it can be done. Right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice helps!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916589,"PostDate":1477526283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey friends!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I am at the very first stages. My fiance and I live in Manhattan, but want destination. I'm a little overwhelmed with the choices & every time I think we found the perfect place we find an issue as to why it won't work. I know it's OUR day & we've already gotten the opinions of everyone imaginable, but we do want to be some what accommodating to our guests. So here are some guidelines \/ dreams we are hoping to find:<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking Bahamas, mainly because it is a short flight from NYC. It's also the only island we have been to together in the Caribbean.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What other options are close?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We don't want to blow the bank - $30K MAX.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We liked Sandals, either Bahamas or Jamaica, but they are adults only.<\/p>\n<p>As great as that sounds, there is a handful of close friends that would have to bring their kids.. and we're cool with that.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Loved the Cove Eleuthera, but it seems super secluded. We don't want our guests to have to go broke over us if they only have the hotel's restaurants to choose choose from.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we might want all inclusive, but not a spring break atmosphere..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm probably talking myself into a corner, but I know it can be done. Right?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice helps!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissakworo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.203.215.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1477523939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Melissakworo","Id":287954,"Name":"Melissakworo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.47.210.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c2c53d7833c8a573d7fc68fc987a278","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Melissakworo, and Congrats on your engagement and planning for a destination wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in the romantic Riviera Maya, Mexico, which is a highly popular destination for so many MANY wedding couples :) You can see some very beautiful reasons why in these magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured here lately......enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/10\/04\/King-Queen-joined-and-the-Grand-Sunset-Princess&#039;&gt;Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and this from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/08\/11\/Sun-Sand-Rain-Shine-this-Grand-Palladium-Wedding-day-has-it-all&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...and this is from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/21\/Imagine-the-impossible-on-your-Wedding-Day-at-Iberostar-Tucan-Playa-del-Carmen&#039;&gt;Iberostar Tucan Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find all the answers you&#039;re looking for! Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916595,"PostDate":1477607793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Melissakworo, and Congrats on your engagement and planning for a destination wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're based in the romantic Riviera Maya, Mexico, which is a highly popular destination for so many MANY wedding couples <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> You can see some very beautiful reasons why in these magical wedding moments that matter we've captured here lately......enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/10\/04\/King-Queen-joined-and-the-Grand-Sunset-Princess' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and this from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/08\/11\/Sun-Sand-Rain-Shine-this-Grand-Palladium-Wedding-day-has-it-all' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...and this is from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/21\/Imagine-the-impossible-on-your-Wedding-Day-at-Iberostar-Tucan-Playa-del-Carmen' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Iberostar Tucan Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find all the answers you're looking for! Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.107.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47e8be542144457c63cd655412519e71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey @[member=\"Melissakworo\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have so many options, the Bahamas is so pretty, but Cancun and the Mayan Riviera are too. It\u00b4s a 3:50 minutes straight flight away from NYC. Have you think about it? And is so pretty.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a lot of Resorts with really good packages for different budgets, some of them have amenities and activities for your guest\u00b4s kids, they are really going to love them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The good news are that you are at the right place, we are here to help you, just click at the Resort Reviews, believe me, there are options with really good prices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me show you some of my Cancun, Riviera Maya pictures. Just take a look, you are going to love them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is Now Jade...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\" alt=\"now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Look at this... Breath taking.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/IMG_6263.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6263.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can find more at my Web Page and my facebook fanpage.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916596,"PostDate":1477609775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287954-melissakworo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Melissakworo<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have so many options, the Bahamas is so pretty, but Cancun and the Mayan Riviera are too. It\u00b4s a 3:50 minutes straight flight away from NYC. Have you think about it? And is so pretty.<\/p>\n<p>There are a lot of Resorts with really good packages for different budgets, some of them have amenities and activities for your guest\u00b4s kids, they are really going to love them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The good news are that you are at the right place, we are here to help you, just click at the Resort Reviews, believe me, there are options with really good prices.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me show you some of my Cancun, Riviera Maya pictures. Just take a look, you are going to love them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is Now Jade...<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\" alt=\"now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Look at this... Breath taking.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/IMG_6263.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6263.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can find more at my Web Page and my facebook fanpage.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<img src='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/BDW\/firma.jpg' alt='Posted Image' class='bbc_img' \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\nGonzalo Nunez - WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com'>www.gonzalonunez.com<\/a> - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/GonzaloNunezWeddingPhotographer'>Facebook Fanpage<\/a><br \/>\nCancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Mexico, rest of the world.","Email":"info@gonzalonunez.com","IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1282067479,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gonzaloNunez","Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
